    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Precognition through a repaired pane.</em></p><p>At the start of a <strong>scene</strong> (combat encounter, tense negotiation, or major exploration beat), roll <strong>2d10</strong> in secret and record the results as <strong>refraction dice</strong>.</p><ul><li>Before any creature (including you) rolls a 2d10 for an attack, attribute check, or defense check, you may choose to <strong>replace</strong> that roll with one of your stored refraction dice.</li><li>You must decide before the 2d10 is rolled. Once used, a refraction die is expended.</li><li>You refresh your refraction dice at the start of each new qualifying scene.</li></ul><p><strong>Strategic Layer.</strong> Once per <strong>turn</strong>, you may spend <strong>10 Intrigue marks</strong> to force an enemy faction to <strong>reroll</strong> one of its strategic 2d10-based checks (GM chooses the exact check if multiple candidates exist). You must accept the new result.</p><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"wlForesightRefr\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d4b8e8;margin-bottom:0.25rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Foresight Refraction</strong></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.86rem;opacity:0.92;line-height:1.4\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 2d10/scene + 1/turn &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Action:</strong> Free (declare before 2d10) &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;margin-top:0.3rem\">At scene start, roll 2d10 in secret as refraction dice. Before any 2d10 (yours or anyone's) replace it with one stored die — declared before the roll. Strategic: 1/Turn, spend 10 Intrigue marks to force an enemy faction reroll.</div>\n</div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
